stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Discovered
    Discovered --> EligibilityChecked
    EligibilityChecked --> NotEligible: hard rule fails
    EligibilityChecked --> Preparing: eligible or potentially eligible
    Preparing --> ReadyToSubmit: documents and materials validated
    ReadyToSubmit --> Submitted
    Submitted --> InstituteVerification
    InstituteVerification --> Returned: correction requested
    Returned --> Preparing
    InstituteVerification --> HigherLevelVerification: INO approves
    HigherLevelVerification --> Sanctioned: DNO / SNO / ministry approves
    HigherLevelVerification --> Rejected
    Sanctioned --> Disbursed: DBT credited
    Disbursed --> RenewalDue
    RenewalDue --> Preparing: renewal window opens
    NotEligible --> [*]
    Rejected --> [*]
